  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup vegetable oil",
    "2 eggs",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "4 cups apples - peeled, cored and diced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour a 9x13-inch cake pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NHKmLNZKceU4XgVFsuCqHh62eik=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7915-german-apple-cake-VAT-step-01-cb1d9613e3ce4e2e938ac665acb61fb2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7915/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat oil and eggs in a large bowl with an electric mixer until creamy. Add sugar and vanilla extract; beat until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0QQEXIoCNog9xNbz0Vmott3Wo5I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7915-german-apple-cake-VAT-step-02-ff2da90260814c16b69a26cb6b79584b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7915/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, cinnamon, baking soda, and salt together in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lqBCeKUcSEM-xM_p4i95yxLIb9s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7915-german-apple-cake-VAT-step-03-4e03b64c20724420aff9c5ffed2da6a0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7915/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually stir flour mixture into oil-egg mixture until just combined; batter will be very thick. Fold in apples using a wooden spoon or spatula.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T0RZ2_3p2nPPbu7NqAiP326gk3c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7915-german-apple-cake-VAT-step-04-2b5c7259b9254463aaa1cd82eff204fe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7915/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread batter into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iw2w18wIc_8fi7tkb6MXIdrPpjA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7915-german-apple-cake-VAT-step-05-cbeb26a287b94fe7a0eccedd0a60e735.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7915/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in center comes out clean, about 45 minutes. Cool cake on a wire rack before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ENqGcJofe1d5447yaZu0TjJZR2s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7915-german-apple-cake-VAT-step-06-04a7b254edc34e75ba65523086f8de70.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7915/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
